OL,5,G0340 Witness History - Pickles and the
OL,6,G     stolen World Cup
OL,7,     FIn 1966 England won the football
OL,8,     FWorld Cup. But would there be a
OL,9,     Ftrophy to collect? Simon Watts
OL,10,     Finvestigates the story.
OL,11,G0350 Promenade Rock (Omnibus)
OL,12,     F1/2. 1950s Llantwit-on-Sea:
OL,13,     FRecently widowed Eirlys Richards
OL,14,     Fwelcomes a new guest at her lively
OL,15,     Fboarding house. Stars Nerys
OL,16,     FHughes.
OL,17,G0500 Know Your Place
OL,18,     F4/8. Is it wedding bells for
OL,19,     Fcaretaker Ramsay in a quest to
OL,20,     Fkeep his job? Stars Roy Dotrice
OL,21,     Fand Patricia Hayes. From 1982.
